  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200C.",
    "Wash scallop shells and dry them thoroughly.",
    "Drizzle a small amount of olive oil inside each shell.",
    "In a bowl mix grated cheese, minced garlic, red chili flakes, lemon zest, parsley, salt and pepper.",
    "Spoon the cheese mixture evenly into each shell.",
    "Place the filled shells on a baking tray.",
    "Bake for 12 minutes until the cheese is melted and edges are lightly browned.",
    "Remove from oven, let cool for 2 minutes, then serve immediately."
